 "remarks": "A rare opportunity at 666 Main Avenue! This one-of-a-kind luxury end-unit townhouse offers nearly 2,000 sq. ft. of beautifully maintained living space and the feel of a home without the upkeep. Soaring vaulted ceilings, skylights and oversized windows fill the interior with natural light, while expansive front and rear decking-including a 40-foot deck-creates exceptional outdoor living and entertaining space. The updated kitchen features a breakfast bar and flows into a generous dining room, with a separate living room offering space to gather and unwind. Upstairs, two spacious bedrooms are joined by a fabulous open loft overlooking the living area-perfect for a home office, sitting room or creative space. Updated baths, custom closets, main-level laundry and additional basement storage complete the home. Step downstairs and enjoy a distinctly urban, New York-style lifestyle with local favorites including Letizia's Pizza, Michele's Pies and incredible Korean cuisine right outside your door. Generous parking for owners and guests. Ideally located on the Wilton border in the heart of shopping, dining and breweries, with quick access to Route 7, I-95 and the Merritt Parkway. A truly unique home alternative!",
